# Mail > Microsoft Excel > app.lexoffice.de

Sextant saw this 5 times. It takes about 1.5 hours a week. Automation potential is 0.73 and the suggested action is automate.

## Steps

1. Mail: attached inv invoice (email, potential 0.60)
2. Microsoft Excel: invoices xlsx (spreadsheet, potential 0.66)
3. app.lexoffice.de: bearbeiten lexoffice rechnung vouchers (finance, potential 0.61)

Start with: app.lexoffice.de: bearbeiten lexoffice rechnung vouchers.

## Data copied by hand

- Mail: attached inv invoice to Microsoft Excel: invoices xlsx: 2 copy events. Read the value from the source and write it to the target.
- Microsoft Excel: invoices xlsx to app.lexoffice.de: bearbeiten lexoffice rechnung vouchers: 2 copy events. Read the value from the source and write it to the target.

## Example cases

- INV-2026-0412: Mon 2026-03-02 to Tue 2026-03-03, Mail: attached inv invoice > Microsoft Excel: invoices xlsx > app.lexoffice.de: bearbeiten lexoffice rechnung vouchers
- RE-2026-0415: Mon 2026-03-02 to Wed 2026-03-04, Mail: angehängt re rechnung > Microsoft Excel: invoices xlsx > app.lexoffice.de: bearbeiten lexoffice rechnung vouchers
- INV-2026-0418: Tue 2026-03-03 to Thu 2026-03-05, Mail: attached inv invoice > Microsoft Excel: invoices xlsx > app.lexoffice.de: bearbeiten lexoffice rechnung vouchers

## Open promises

- Mon 2026-03-02: I'll send the invoice attached to Acme later.
- Wed 2026-03-04: Send reminder for INV-2026-0423 (overdue)
- Wed 2026-03-04: I'll send the corrected INV-2026-0412 tomorrow. (overdue)

## Rules

- Show the user what you will do before you send, pay or delete anything.
- Stop and ask when a value is missing or two sources disagree.

## Why Sextant picked it

- hours_week 1.51: 90 min over 5 observed days, scaled to a 5-day week
- potential 0.73: time-weighted mean 0.63 of 4 steps, +0.10 because data is copied by hand
- copy: 2 times from Mail: attached inv invoice to Microsoft Excel: invoices xlsx
- copy: 2 times from Microsoft Excel: invoices xlsx to app.lexoffice.de: bearbeiten lexoffice rechnung vouchers
- desire 0.60: enjoyment unknown
- benefit 0.66 = 1.51 h x 0.73 x 0.60
- procrastination 0.70: 2 overdue promises x 0.35, 0 abandoned opens x 0.15, 1.7 waiting days (0.1 per day over 2)
- kind friction: 4 hand copies, 2.7 app switches per hour
- action automate: potential 0.60 or more and 0.5 h per week or more
- first step: app.lexoffice.de: bearbeiten lexoffice rechnung vouchers has the highest potential x time
